  "title": "Pamnest Twin Halloween Comforter Set with Sheets, 5 Pieces - Design 04",
  "handle": "pamnest-twin-halloween-comforter-set-with-sheets-5-pieces-design-04",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a cozy and stylish retreat with this Jeminise Comforter Set. Crafted for exceptional softness and breathability, this set promises a peaceful night's sleep while adding a touch of Halloween charm to your decor.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Filled with finely brushed microfibers for outstanding softness, lightness, and breathability, ensuring maximum comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This 5-piece set includes one comforter (68\" x 90\"), one flat sheet (66\" x 92\"), one fitted sheet (39\" x 80\" x 14\"), one pillowcase (20\" x 30\"), and one pillow sham (20\" x 30\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Exquisite Design:</strong> Features stylish and exquisite patterns that bring a fashionable and cozy aesthetic to your sleeping space.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Durable Stitching:</strong> Comforter boasts exquisite stitching to enhance durability and prevent filling from shifting or clumping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Fit Fitted Sheet:</strong> The deep-pocket fitted sheet includes an elastic band on all four sides, accommodating mattresses up to 14 inches thick for a secure fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Simply machine wash in cold water and tumble dry on low; designed to withstand years of use without weakening or tearing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Selected Design:</strong> Features a 'Ghost 1' design with pumpkin, ghost, and bat patterns, perfect for a Halloween theme.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Brushed Microfiber and Polyester Filling.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Ghost 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Horror Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Pumpkin,Ghost,Bats</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Ghost 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 x Comforter &amp; 1 x Pillowcase &amp; 1 x Pillow Sham &amp; 1 x Fitted Sheet &amp; 1 x Flat Sheet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Twin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>90 x 68 x 1 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Deep-pocket fitted sheet fits up to 14 inch mattresses.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All, Fall, Summer, Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
